# ============================================================
# ZYT.ESG — .gitignore for the PUBLIC repo (jtzyt24/ZYT-ESG)
#
# This repo is public and serves the live GitHub Pages site.
# The files below contain internal architecture notes, the full
# Supabase schema, and project status commentary that should
# never be pushed here — they belong only in a private working
# copy. This file exists specifically because PROJECT_STATUS.md
# and DATA_INVENTORY.md were accidentally pushed to the (now
# private) zyt-esg-app repo on 2026-06-16 — see PROJECT_STATUS.md
# in your private copy for the full incident note.
#
# IMPORTANT: git only ignores files going forward from when this
# .gitignore is added. If any of these files are already tracked
# in this repo's history, adding this file alone does NOT remove
# them from past commits — see the note in your private
# PROJECT_STATUS.md about history rewriting if full historical
# removal is ever needed.
# ============================================================

# Internal project documentation — architecture notes, roadmap,
# retrofit history. Not needed for the live site to function.
PROJECT_STATUS.md

# PDPA Step 2.1 personal data inventory — internal compliance
# working doc, not part of the deployed app.
DATA_INVENTORY.md

# Full Supabase schema (table definitions, RLS policies, seed
# data, triggers). The live app only needs the Supabase anon/
# public key (already in js/supabase.js, by design exposable) —
# it never needs the schema file itself.
database.sql

# Legacy Netlify config — unused since GitHub Pages became the
# deploy target. Harmless if pushed, but doesn't belong here.
netlify.toml

# Common editor/OS clutter — never useful in a deploy repo
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
